{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo contains 3 levels, as a level experience rather than a game where the numbers get bigger, the monsters and bosses have been carefully designed, and the boss battles are the only ones where you have to face multiple bosses, each with at least 2 stages (never a wheel battle).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without considering the number of levels, this demo contains 80% of the content of the official game, such as character skills are complete. However, level progress saves, ghosts and flying enemies, more props, etc. are not open, though they hint at their existence in the skill descriptions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Drive out animals</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/extras/wuYa-616.gif?t=1747792501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Fight against multiple bosses</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/extras/boss-616.gif?t=1747792501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Let your friends save you</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/extras/save-616.gif?t=1747792501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <u><strong>Celebrating Victory</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/extras/win-616.gif?t=1747792501\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712850?t=1747792501","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712850?t=1747792501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/8c2bf6980f0447c9f1b301595520fa5cab22f69f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747792501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/8c2bf6980f0447c9f1b301595520fa5cab22f69f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747792501","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Looking for teammates? </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking for teammates? Visit our <strong>Community Hub</strong> to join the conversation and find our official Discord link!&quot;</p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo contains 3 levels, as a level experience rather than a game where the numbers get bigger, the monsters and bosses have been carefully designed, and the boss battles are the only ones where you have to face multiple bosses, each with at least 2 stages (never a wheel battle).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without considering the number of levels, this demo contains 80% of the content of the official game, such as character skills are complete. However, level progress saves, ghosts and flying enemies, more props, etc. are not open, though they hint at their existence in the skill descriptions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Drive out animals</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/extras/wuYa-616.gif?t=1747792501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Fight against multiple bosses</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712850/extras/boss-616.gif?t=1747792501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Let your friends save you</u></strong></